<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI25-ATMQA-004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI25-ATMQA-004" ;
  triage:title "PeerConfigDoctorReport exposes only aggregate counts + fingerprint, never hostname/port" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-core/src/doctor/report.rs: PeerConfigDoctorReport struct (lines ~111-120) exposes only aggregate counts + fingerprint, never the peer hostname or configured port that the AI.25 Implementation map requires. Negative constraints (no private-key/resolved-IP leakage) ARE satisfied. Reported by req-qa (ATM-QA-004) during AICH-S5 QA-1 against feature/pAI-s25-peer-authority-resolution." ;
